@document
  title: Rich Expressions Demo
  author: Gemini

@meta
  user:
    name: Alice
    age: 30
    isMember: true
    hasCoupon: false
  cart:
    items: 5
    total: 150.00
    shipping: 10.00

# Rich Expressions Demo

Hello {{user.name}}!

## Arithmetic
Your cart total is ${{cart.total}}.
Shipping is ${{cart.shipping}}.
Grand Total: ${{cart.total + cart.shipping}}

## Comparison
@if cart.total > 100
  **You qualify for premium support!** (Total > 100)
@else
  Standard support.
@end

## Logic
@if user.isMember && (cart.total > 200 || user.hasCoupon)
  **Discount Applied!** (Member AND (Order > 200 OR Coupon))
@else
  No discount applied today.
@end

## Complex Math
Calculation (5 * 10 + 2): {{5 * 10 + 2}}
Grouping (5 * (10 + 2)): {{5 * (10 + 2)}}

## Nested Logic
@if (user.age >= 18 && user.age < 65) && user.isMember
  Target demographic: Adult Member.
@end
